  "details": "I just went to look into the status of showing impostors rather than diamonds for distance-culled avatars, and saw that the ticket for it has 238 upvotes, and is three years old, but isn't even marked as \"tracked\", let alone \"interested\"?   I know not everything can be implemented, but it feels like after a certain point, it's worth having a response to all the people who think something would be worth having?   It seems like lots of big tickets have just fallen through the cracks with no explanation; again, this isn't about \"tracked\" tickets not being finished, but about popular tickets not even being noticed, let alone getting a \"here's why we can't do this\" reply...",
